; Post Processor to Suit a CR Onsrud 336G18CW7 with FANUC control
; Created from Doosan BVM Post

; Machine Manufacturer 	- CR Onsrud
; Machine Model			- 336G18CW7
; Machine Type 			- Mill/Router
; Control				- FANUC
; Axes					- XYZ
; Options				- 
; Production Year		- N/A

; Post Created By		- WKE 29/08/2025
; Post Created For		- Mariani
; Post Tested On Site	- N/A
; Post Test Version		- SolidCAM 2025 SP3 HF1


;#region Dev Notes
; 29/08/2025 - V0.0 - WKE 	- Post created
; 29/08/2025 - V0.1 - WKE 	- Post delivered to customer
; 02/09/2025 - V0.2	- WKE	- Vacuum output removed
;							- Hardcoded WO to G56
;							- Removed modality for @arc, @line, @rapid_move etc
;03/09/2025 - V0.2.1 - TSB 	- Changed T1 M6 to M6 T1 on @usr_starttool
;31/07/2026 - V0.3 	 - TSB 	- Added RAH support to @usr_starttool and @arc
;06/08/2026 - V0.4 	 - WKE	- Added programmable C axis
